This product includes software and data developed by others:

- Country boundaries in the web app come from the world-atlas package
  (Mike Bostock, ISC License), which redistributes Natural Earth vector data
  (naturalearthdata.com, public domain).
- Market prices are fetched at run time from Twelve Data under the account holder's own
  plan; no price data is included in this repository.
- Reference data in server/app/reference (regulators, flows, hazards, routes, the gazetteer)
  is compiled for this project from public sources; figures marked "sample" are examples,
  not statistics.

The demo institution (Serendib Commercial Bank) and everything about it is invented.
